#. comic496 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: gshipb.gif
#: kidradd/comic496.htm:71
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic496#p1.1"
msgid "Let's check back on Gnarl and Koba, shall we?"
msgstr "Как там Отпад и Коба? Давайте заглянем к ним."

#. comic496 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: gshipb.gif
#: kidradd/comic496.htm:92
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic496#p1.2"
msgid "I figure it's good to get away from civilization while training."
msgstr "Тренироваться лучше подальше от цивилизации."

#. comic496 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: gshipb.gif
#: kidradd/comic496.htm:96
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic496#p1.3"
msgid "Especially when \"civilization\" is a dictatorship."
msgstr "Особенно когда «цивилизация» — диктатура."

#. comic496 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: gshipt.gif
#: kidradd/comic496.htm:147
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic496#p2.1"
msgid "Perfect! This server looks uninhabited."
msgstr "Отлично! Тут вроде никто не живёт."

#. comic496 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: gshipt.gif
#: kidradd/comic496.htm:151
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic496#p2.2"
msgid "Yeah, nothing but some human programs and files."
msgstr "Ага, только людские программы и файлы."

#. comic496 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: kobastand.gif, gnarlleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic496.htm:200
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic496#p3.1"
msgid "So what do we do now?"
msgstr "Ну и что теперь делаем?"

#. comic496 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: kobastand.gif, gnarlleft.gif
#: kidradd/comic496.htm:204
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic496#p3.2"
msgid "I dunno, I guess just start beatin' each other up until we get better."
msgstr "Не знаю, наверно, просто метелим друг друга, пока не станем лучше."

#. comic496 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: kobagrin.gif, gnarlblink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic496.htm:254
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic496#p4.1"
msgid "Suh-weet! That sounds like fun!"
msgstr "Кла-а-асс! Звучит весело!"

#. comic496 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: kobagrin.gif, gnarlblink2.gif
#: kidradd/comic496.htm:258
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic496#p4.2"
msgid "I'm glad we think so alike."
msgstr "Рад, что мы мыслим одинаково."

#. comic497 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic497.htm:54
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic497#title.1"
msgid "\"DUMB AND DUMBER\""
