#. comic498 panel p2
#. slot: insert ground "tiles" on this line
#: kidradd/comic498.htm:161
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic498#p2.1"
msgid "I didn't mean for Frame 23 of the animation to look that strange. Honest."
msgstr "Я не хотел, чтобы 23-й кадр анимации выглядел так странно. Честно."

#. comic498 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: gnarldizz.gif, kobastand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic498.htm:202
#, fuzzy
