#. comic515 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: cruiserr.gif
#: kidradd/comic515.htm:90
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic515#p1.2"
msgid "Man, I had no idea our past was so screwed up."
msgstr "Блин, я и не знал, что у нас такое стрёмное прошлое."

#. comic515 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: cruiserr.gif
#: kidradd/comic515.htm:94
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic515#p1.3"
msgid "It was a well-guarded secret."
msgstr "Это был тщательно охраняемый секрет."

#. comic515 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: cruiserb.gif
#: kidradd/comic515.htm:161
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic515#p2.1"
msgid "We're here already?"
