#. comic515 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: cruiserb.gif
#: kidradd/comic515.htm:165
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic515#p2.2"
msgid "Yeah, we'll get things taken care of soon enough."
msgstr "Да, скоро со всем разберёмся."

#. comic515 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddback.gif, gitablebs.gif
#: kidradd/comic515.htm:212
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic515#p3.1"
msgid "Uh, this doesn't look anything like the server they were in. Are you sure this is the right place?"
msgstr "Э-э, это совсем не похоже на их сервер. Ты уверен, что мы там, где надо?"

#. comic515 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddback.gif, gitablebs.gif
#: kidradd/comic515.htm:216
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic515#p3.2"
msgid "Oh, it's the right place alright, for what I need to do anyway."
msgstr "О, ещё как там, по крайней мере для того, что мне надо сделать."

#. comic515 panel p4
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic515.htm:260
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic515#p4.1"
msgid "\"Ow!!! What the hell are you doing???\""
msgstr "«Ай!!! Ты что, блин, творишь???»"

#. comic515 panel p4
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic515.htm:261
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic515#p4.2"
msgid "\"I'd prefer you to put up a fight; it'll be more fun that way.\""
msgstr "«Лучше бы ты сопротивлялся — так будет веселее»."

#. comic516 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic516.htm:34
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic516#title.1"
msgid "\"HERE'S HOW\""
msgstr "«ВОТ КАК»"

#. comic516 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: runnfire.gif
#: kidradd/comic516.htm:71
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic516#p1.1"
msgid "\"Are you out of your mind? (Wait, don't answer that...) But why on earth are you attacking me?\""
msgstr "«Ты с ума сошёл? (Стой, не отвечай…) Но зачем ты, чёрт побери, на меня нападаешь?»"

#. comic516 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: runnfire.gif
#: kidradd/comic516.htm:72
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic516#p1.2"
