#. comic516 panel p2
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: gishoot.gif
#: kidradd/comic516.htm:126
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic516#p2.1"
msgid "\"My 'Mind Control' attack doesn't work until the enemy is damaged. Unless they're really weak to begin with, I usually hafta whittle 'em down to about 30% of full power.\""
msgstr "«Моя атака „Контроль разума“ не работает, пока враг не ранен. Если он не слабак с самого начала, обычно приходится сточить его примерно до 30% от полной силы»."

#. comic516 panel p3
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: theyshoot.gif
#: kidradd/comic516.htm:180
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic516#p3.1"
msgid "\"That's not what I'm asking!\""
msgstr "«Я не об этом спрашиваю!»"

#. comic516 panel p3
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: theyshoot.gif
#: kidradd/comic516.htm:181
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic516#p3.2"
msgid "\"Hey, it ain't my fault you're not specific. But keep talking, I'm sure you'll get it soon enough.\""
msgstr "«Эй, я не виноват, что ты неточно выражаешься. Но говори дальше, уверен, скоро сообразишь»."

#. comic517 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic517.htm:47
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic517#title.1"
msgid "\"WHAT I LIKE\""
msgstr "«ВОТ ЭТО ПО МНЕ»"

#. comic517 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: gishoot.gif
#: kidradd/comic517.htm:84
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic517#p1.1"
msgid "\"Sorry, Radd. I know you won't agree with me, but this is for the good of the universe.\""
msgstr "«Прости, Улёт. Знаю, ты со мной не согласишься, но это ради блага вселенной»."

#. comic517 panel p2
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic517.htm:138
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic517#p2.1"
msgid "\"Whatever, dude. Why don't you have some 'good' back yourself...\""
