#. comic517 panel p3
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: more.gif
#: kidradd/comic517.htm:192
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic517#p3.1"
msgid "\"Now <i>that's</i> the kind of fight I'm talking about! Keep it coming!\""
